title: 'C-c r u : skg-diffView-extend'
pid: b0768650-f82a-414f-b41a-88551acaa1ac
body: |2-
  Extends the buffer of the diff view to every change not editable in it.
  Each changed node with no editable occurrence becomes editable where
  the buffer first shows it, in content or else in a partner folder,
  with its change and its content shown under it; when a change is
  under a root the buffer lacks, that root is appended at the end. The
  minibuffer then shows the processed summary, as after a save. Refuses
  with "Save the buffer first." while the buffer has unsaved changes.
  A clean buffer the server rerenders after reloading files changed on
  disk is extended the same way, with no key pressed.
